  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Release 3.6.0: CancellationToken Support & Performance Improvements (MINOR Release - 2025-12-30)\n\nADDED:\n- CancellationToken Support: Comprehensive CancellationToken support across all async methods and interfaces\n  - All async interface methods now accept CancellationToken parameter\n  - Private helper methods updated for cancellation support\n  - Better resource management and graceful cancellation handling\n  - XML documentation updated for all methods with CancellationToken\n\nIMPROVEMENTS:\n- Performance: Replaced Task.Run with native async file I/O methods for better performance\n  - Improved file I/O operations using native async methods\n  - Better resource utilization and reduced overhead\n- Code Quality: Removed unnecessary service and repository logs\n  - Cleaned up excessive logging in service layer\n  - Improved log readability and reduced noise\n\nTECHNICAL DETAILS:\n- 59 files changed: 635 insertions(+), 802 deletions(-)\n- Maintained 0 errors, 0 warnings\n- Full backward compatibility maintained (CancellationToken parameters have default values)\n- Enhanced async/await patterns throughout codebase\n\nThis release adds comprehensive CancellationToken support for better resource management and cancellation handling, while improving performance and code quality.",
